Bundled data of the CrystOD package this server calls

The irreducible-representation labels returned by every tool come from the
ISO-IR tables of the ISOTROPY Software Suite, which CrystOD bundles as
crystod/CIR_data.txt.gz (H. T. Stokes, B. J. Campbell and R. Cordes,
"Tabulated irreducible representations of the crystallographic space
groups", Acta Cryst. A69, 388-395 (2013); https://iso.byu.edu). Please cite
that work when the labels are used in published research; the server appends
this citation to every result.
